00:35:23.425 --> 00:35:25.920
Many of us are reaching for
hybrid cloud nirvana, which

00:35:25.920 --> 00:35:28.410
makes the workplace mobility
between on-premise and cloud

00:35:28.410 --> 00:35:30.222
computing ideal for our work.

00:35:30.222 --> 00:35:31.680
To help us navigate
through this we

00:35:31.680 --> 00:35:33.720
